OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Debris
# Wave 10 demo: mesh particles -- every particle is a small cube (the built-in Meshes/cube.ocmesh), tumbling as it falls, lit by up
# to four nearby scene lights, with a spawn-at flag so Particles.SpawnAt can use it for impacts. It bounces off the world plane z = 0.
EMITTER Debris
SIM auto
SHAPE sphere 8
BLEND opaque
EMISSION 0 80 2048
LIFETIME 2.5 4
DIRECTION 0 0 1 60
SPEED 250 600
GRAVITY 0 0 -980
DAMPING 0.05
SIZE 7 7
COLOR start 0.55 0.5 0.45 1
COLOR end 0.55 0.5 0.45 1
RENDER mesh Meshes/cube.ocmesh spin
SORT none
LIGHTING lit
FOG on
GI on
SPAWNAT on
BOUNDS 1500
MODULE spawn.sizescale min=0.4 max=1.6
MODULE spawn.rotation minDeg=0 maxDeg=360 spinMin=-540 spinMax=540
MODULE update.collideplane nx=0 ny=0 nz=1 d=0 restitution=0.35 friction=0.5 kill=0
